Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.13,0:00:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生日快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生日快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.72,0:00:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  别这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, come on. Rach!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你的生日啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不像她29岁时那么漂亮了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's not as pretty as she was when she was 29.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.77,0:00:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在葛林小姐出来之前  要先把几件事说清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ms. Green would like to establish some ground rules before she comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她希望你们不要用到如"或者" "走下坡"等字眼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She would appreciate it if you didn't use the words "old" or "downhill"...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是 "它们看来还是很棒"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...or "They still look pretty damn good."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们还是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.29,0:00:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡做了早餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica made breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巧克力碎片松饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chocolate chip pancakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有礼物给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We've got presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.21,0:00:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是两星期前你给的单子上的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They all came from the list you handed out to us two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以只收礼物  而仍然是29岁吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, can I keep the presents and still be 29?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.35,0:01:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  30岁也没什么大不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Rach, look, turning 3O is not that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.19,0:01:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的嘛  你满30岁时也是这么觉得吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, really? Is that how you felt when you turned 30?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  上帝  为什么啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why, God, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们讲好的了  让其他人变老  我不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We had a deal. Let the others grow old, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.03,0:01:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有我这样吗  是我反应过度吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on, you guys, is it just me? Am I overreacting to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是只有你  我的30岁生日也不好过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Rach, it is not just you. My 30th birthday certainly wasn't that much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.29,0:01:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在该钱德了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And now Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都变得这么老了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're all getting so old.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这样对我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why are you doing this to us'?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第七季  第14集  步入三十\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S07E14  The One Where They All Turn Thirty
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.81,0:01:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.06,0:01:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.32,0:02:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.91,0:02:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.05,0:02:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（瑞秋30岁生日快乐）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的生活过得很好  有很棒的工作  很好的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, you're in a great place in your life. You have an amazing job, good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.39,0:02:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的室友是连续剧明星\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, your roommate's a soap opera star.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.77,0:02:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的角色在昏迷中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your character is in a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.85,0:02:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我答应自己这个生日一定不哭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I promised myself I wasn't gonna cry at this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我目前过得很好  但我看到一些人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know my life's going pretty well, but I see so many people...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.15,0:02:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在30岁以前  就完成了他们的目标\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...who've accomplished so many of their goals by the time they're 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你不应该和我比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but you shouldn't compare yourself to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来  菲比  你做得到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Phoebe. You can do it Phoebe! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.37,0:02:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了  好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我成功了  在跳跳球上走了一哩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did it. One mile on a Hippity Hop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,30岁前我想完成的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it. That's everything I wanted to do before I was 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了我想和我妹修好关系外\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, except I wanted to patch things up with my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.35,0:03:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  可是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well. But, yaw.!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女人  这东西是上帝给的礼物  如果你懂我的意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, girls, this thing is a godsend, if you know what I mean. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.91,0:03:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来做点有趣的事吧  今天你想做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, let's have some fun, huh? What do you want to do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么也不做   我什么也不想做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing. I don't want to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.37,0:03:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在30岁生日时什么都不做  总比像罗斯一样做傻事好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, doing nothing on your 30th is better than doing something stupid, like Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.45,0:03:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是很实际的一次购买\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, that was a practical purchase.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要那个车子做交通工具\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I needed that car for transportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.80,0:03:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  我有小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? I have a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这车里看来很拉风吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How hot do I look in this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  一台跑车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, a sports car?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.22,0:03:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在裤子里塞袜子不是比较便宜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wouldn't it be cheaper to just stuff a sock down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是为了那个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not what this is about, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是跑车爱好者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am a sports car enthusiast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.23,0:04:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都很喜欢车  它的马力多少\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've always been into cars. What's the horsepower on this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  看看它多亮呀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know, but look how shiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.16,0:04:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然买了这台车  帅哥  那就载我一程吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe you bought this. So can I have a ride, stud?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上车吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hop in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.92,0:04:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好你这辈子最稳的一程\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get ready for the smoothest ride of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好了  下一个是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我一定要做点什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? I am gonna do something today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.37,0:04:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能像老太太一样闲坐在这儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not just gonna sit around like some old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.58,0:04:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要在身上打个洞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to get something pierced.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像是鼻子  舌头  或是别的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like my, uh, nose or my tongue or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  那样会痛的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Because, you know, that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.71,0:05:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样   我是这么想的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what? You know, the way I see it--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ow! Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我知道你经历过的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Rachel, I know what you're going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.97,0:05:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我25岁生日时吓坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm totally freaked out about turning 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离开我家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get out, get out of my apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你做的很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, for what it's worth, I think that you're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正视事实吧  没有人能真的  好好处理这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, y'know let's face it, no one handles this well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少你不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. Least of all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放回去吧   摩妮卡随时会到家的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you put that back on. Monica's gonna be here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我的 "乔伊结"会痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it hurts my Joey's apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次告诉你那叫喉结   不是以每一个人的名字命名的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, for the last time, it's not named after each individual man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你宴会办得真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You've done a wonderful job with this party, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每样东西看起来都很美丽  没有像你这么美丽的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everything looks so lovely. Oh, well, not as lovely as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.89,0:05:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能相信你有位30岁的女儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I can't believe you would have a 30-year-old daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能相信你有件30岁的燕尾服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you, I can't believe you would have a tux that's 30 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不止30年  怀上罗斯那次  这件燕尼服就有了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's older than that. Ross was actually conceived right near this tuxedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.03,0:06:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家躲起来  我看到她了  她来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, everybody hide. I saw her. She's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蹲下  大家蹲下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay. Everybody down. Everybody down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留在这儿  我来看看怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, everybody stay here. I will find out what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你开门了  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you got the door open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你喝醉了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, are you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.73,0:06:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对要满30岁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See I was, I was a little nervous about turning...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是有点紧张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...30.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.74,0:06:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收碗的小弟带我去喝酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So the busboys took me out for some drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:07:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,待会可能会吐在你身上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Might want to puke on you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事情是这样的  我们替你办了一个惊喜宴会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, here's the thing. We have thrown a very formal surprise party for you in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友和父母都在里面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All your friends are in there and your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.63,0:07:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.84,0:07:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  不  我父母从没看我醉过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. My parents have never seen me drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就他们所知\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That they know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样  我们替你弄点咖啡喝   他们就不知道你醉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Here's the thing. We'll get you some coffee and they will never know that you're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  你确定  我会处理好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really, you promise? Yeah, I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.65,0:07:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.03,0:07:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  要处理处理你口里的酒气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, we have to do something about your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你的酒气呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about your breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那还是你的酒气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's still yours.
