Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.02,0:14:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的计划很有效\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The plan's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没脱掉上衣呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't even have to take off my top yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,演讲  来吧  演讲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Speech. Come on, speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊  演讲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. Speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.70,0:15:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你离开她一秒都不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Chandler, you can't keep your hands off her for one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.16,0:15:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I think it's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think it's necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.17,0:15:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要谢谢大家来到这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wanna thank you all for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的家人和我的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My family and my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.64,0:15:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想说我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd really like to say that I'm, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我真的很想说什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what I'd really like to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我醉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  爸  妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right, Morn and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.15,0:15:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的小口琴醉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your little "Harmomica" is hammered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜怎么着  我以前也喝醉过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And guess what? I've been drunk before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我抽过烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I've smoked a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道吗  知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you know what? You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.75,0:16:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  没关系  因为我今天满30岁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's all okay. It's okay, because I turned 3O today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.84,0:16:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想做什么就做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I can do anything I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是成年人了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I am a grownup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.40,0:16:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  快  替我脱掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, quick. Help me get this off. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我失去了整整一年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I lost a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不能相信  真不公平\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe it. This is so unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  没有关系的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Pheebs, it'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.91,0:16:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will it? Will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你发现你变31岁了  你会怎么感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How would you feel if you found out you were 31?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.41,0:16:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会的  因为我们有个新约定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not gonna happen, you know, because we have a new deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  这毁了我的时间表\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Plus, it totally ruined my schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没做那些我31岁前想做的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I haven't done any of the things I wanted to do by the time I was 31.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像什么  像是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like what? Like, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.05,0:16:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还不认识任何葡萄牙人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I haven't met any Portuguese people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:17:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没有完美地接吻过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I haven't had the perfect kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没去上狙击手学校\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I haven't been to sniper school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我们去吃蛋糕吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, y'know why don't we go upstairs and have some birthday cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想一个人静一下  好吗  待会见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I just feel like being by myself for a while, all right? I'll see you guys later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.11,0:17:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, poor Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.62,0:17:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  知道吗  我想我应该陪她走回家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you know what, you guys? I think I'm gonna go walk her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天  怎么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会吃了蛋糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's gonna eat the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs. Wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.96,0:17:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.18,0:17:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭上眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以将这一项从单子上划掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe that's one you can cross off your list.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.99,0:17:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.49,0:18:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  我是16分之1的葡萄牙人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, and plus, I'm one-sixteenth Portuguese.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.50,0:18:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  大家都清楚了  我们要将它抬起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, is everybody clear? We're gonna pick it up...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后移动它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只需要团队合作  懂吧  我们要抬起这台车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All we need is teamwork, okay? We're gonna lift the car...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.84,0:18:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把它滑出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and slide it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抬起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Lift...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滑出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯   抬起来  我真的不觉得这  抬起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, I really don't think this-Lift...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.61,0:18:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滑出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.19,0:18:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  开始吧  大伙儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, here we go. All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抬起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Lift...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.41,0:18:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,移出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  乔伊  别这样  瑞秋  才刚轮到我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey-Oh, come on, Rach, my turn just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.84,0:18:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实呢  我是要和泰格说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, I just want to talk to Tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:18:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  好的  嘿  我可以到外面溜溜吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay. Hey, can I ride this outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便  我不是你妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whatever, okay? I'm not your mother. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要到街上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not in the street! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有觉得好点  有  我很好  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How you doing, you feeling any better? Yeah, I'm doing okay. I'm, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's talk. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um... What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,秦格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Tag, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.57,0:19:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个好男人  我们在一起也很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're such a great guy, and we have so much fun together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我  等下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I don't-I don't... Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.45,0:19:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你要做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think I see where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你说任何话之前  我可以先说一件事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But before you say anything else, can I just say one more thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.89,0:19:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说的好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正是我所谓很开心的好例子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And a, uh, good example of the fun I was referring to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我想  我已经过了只要开心就好的时候了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, but, heh, I just think I'm past the point where I can, you know, just have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  不要这样  这只是因为你30岁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, don't do this. This is just because you're turning 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.19,0:20:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.49,0:20:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你还只是个孩子  你才25岁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you're just a kid. I mean, you're 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.45,0:20:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实是24岁  老天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Twenty-four, actually. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.29,0:20:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我希望什么  我希望你比现在大6岁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what I wish? I wish you were six years older.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果真是希望的话  我倒希望自己年轻6岁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, actually, if I'm wishing for stuff, I actually wish I was six years younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.84,0:20:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是  是啊  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me too. Yeah. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  谈得怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, how'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.19,0:20:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我只要生两个孩子  我可以再保留他一年吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I only want two kids, can I keep him for another year?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.49,0:20:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做的对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.87,0:20:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢它了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't like this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这儿的   一群30岁的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, here we are. Just a bunch of 30-year-olds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道再过10年  我们就40岁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, do you realize in 10 years we're gonna be 40?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.01,0:21:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  上帝  为什么这么对我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why, God? Why are you doing this to us'?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  我的宝贝终于自由了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. My baby's finally free.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.03,0:21:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,启动   我们走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Start it up. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.62,0:21:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa-how.!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.87,0:21:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们拉不拉风\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How hot are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.22,0:21:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要买车吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wanna buy a car?
